sequenceDiagram
    participant C as MCP client
    participant S as FastMCP server (OAuth proxy)
    participant E as Entra ID
    participant A as Azure DevOps

    C->>S: GET /mcp (no token)
    S-->>C: 401 + WWW-Authenticate (resource metadata URL)
    C->>S: Discover metadata, register client (proxy handles DCR)
    C->>S: /authorize (PKCE)
    S->>E: Redirect user to Entra login (scopes: api://<app>/mcp.access + ADO scope)
    E-->>S: Auth code at /auth/callback
    S->>E: Exchange code for tokens (user token, aud = our API)
    S-->>C: Proxy-issued token for the MCP session
    C->>S: tools/call get_work_item (Bearer token)
    S->>S: Validate token, load user's upstream Entra token
    S->>E: OBO: assertion = user token, scope = ADO
    E-->>S: Azure DevOps access token (user context)
    S->>A: GET _apis/wit/workitems/1234 (Bearer ADO token)
    A-->>S: Work item JSON
    S-->>C: Curated result
